{
    "article_summary": "The article describes a photocatalytic strategy for the divergent synthesis of polycyclic indoles and indolines from indole-tethered ketones. By using a novel organic photocatalyst, isoazatruxene ITN-2, the reaction pathway can be tuned toward either C-H functionalization (aromatization) under redox-neutral conditions or dearomatization under net-reductive conditions (using Hantzsch ester as a reductant).",
